But I think we all have that imposter syndrome of what authority or authenticity to have talked about these things, but to me, for what it's worth, you're doing a beautiful thing by talking about all of this and your journey and you are part of that community and you're using your talents and your voice to talk about it and that makes you a part of the community and you already were too.
但我认为我们都有冒名顶替综合症，认为谈论这些事情有什么权威或真实性，但对我来说，无论它的价值如何，通过谈论所有这些和你的旅程，你正在做一件美丽的事情，你是这个社区的一部分，你正在利用你的才能和你的声音来谈论它，这使你成为社区的一部分，而且你已经是了。

