And so with that community says it hurts them, which they do say that, then the argument that it's just this word that's been abstracted and now it's just a funny word and nobody cares, people care.
因此，那个社区说这伤害了他们，他们确实这么说，然后争论说这只是这个词被抽象了，现在它只是一个有趣的词，没有人关心，人们关心。

